(card "exp:H-R3b-0_c84_binary_baseline" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:H-R3b-0_c84_binary_baseline"
  :body "---\nnav: 9\ntype: experiment\nid: H-R3b-0-binary\nshort_name: c84_binary_baseline\ntitle: \"H-R3b-0 — C8.4 × size=1.0 (binary baseline, λ=0)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: h\nround: r3b\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_h__sizing]]\"\ntrain_nav: 3.1544\ntrain_trade_count: 179\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8771\ntrain_sharpe: 8.3351\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0047\nval_nav_mean: 1.0887\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0902\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.4058\ntest_trade_count: 31\ntest_sharpe: 7.7042\ntest_win_rate: 0.8065\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0029\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: baseline\noutcome: test_pass\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [sizing, baseline]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T03:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/h, round/r3b, axis/sizing, axis/baseline, status/baseline, outcome/test_pass, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# H-R3b-0 — C8.4 × size=1.0 (binary baseline, λ=0)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— H 系列 sizing 的 λ=0 reference baseline：**C8.4 trade selector + 固定 size 1.0**，等价于直接跑 C8.4 不加任何 sizing。NAV/sharpe/dd 与 [[arc_260516a__team_c__C8.4__top3_no_open3min_bypass]] **bit-for-bit 相同**，留在 R3b sweep 里专门给 sizing-axis ablation 用：sizing 贡献 = R3b-4 − R3b-0 = 0.55 train NAV。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 不是 hypothesis，是 **ablation control**：让 sizing 公式 = constant 1.0，验证后续 R3b sweep 的 NAV gain 是否真来自 sizing 而非 sample noise。\n- 如果 λ=0 已经 beat anchor，说明 NAV gain 主要来自 C8.4 selector；若 λ>0 才 beat，说明 sizing 是关键。R3b-0 NAV 3.15 已 >> anchor 2.19，**说明 NAV gain 主体来自 selector，sizing 只在边际加成**。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/scripts/round_3b_runner.py`\n- 公式：\n  $$ \\text{size}(t) = 1.0 \\quad \\forall t $$\n- mean_size = 1.0, std_size = 0.0.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 不用任何 rolling stat（size 是常数）。**无 lookahead 风险**。\n- 注意：H-R3b-0 本身不需要 warmup，但 R3b 其它档需要 → engineer 还是跑 rolling helper 但 size 输出固定 1.0，保证 trade pool 完全一致。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 3.1544 | 179 | 8.34 | 87.7% | -0.47% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0887 ± 0.090 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.4058 | 31 | 7.70 | 80.6% | -0.29% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | +0.157 | +11 | +0.55 | +5.6pp | +0.24pp |\n| **Δ R3b-4 vs R3b-0 (sizing contribution)** | +0.085 train NAV / +0.085 test NAV | - | - | - | - |\n\n注意 R3b-0 sharpe 8.34 是 R3b sweep 最高（size=1 单笔波动最小）。\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0（baseline 不存在 overfit 概念）。\n- nav_champion=False 是因为 R3b 同 round 内被 λ>0 档超越。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **same_metrics_as**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__C8.4__top3_no_open3min_bypass]] (bit-for-bit)\n- **ablation_control_for**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-4__c84_kelly_lambda_1.5]], [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-1__c84_kelly_lambda_0.25]], [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-2__c84_kelly_lambda_0.5]], [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-3__c84_kelly_lambda_1.0]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (R3b-0)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **方法论 lesson**：任何 sizing-axis 实验必须包含 λ=0 / size=const baseline，否则没法判断 sizing add 了多少。R3b 系列做对了这条 —— 下次 arc 必须沿用。\n- R3b-0 vs C8.4 数字一致是 sanity，但**当 sizing helper 引入 bug 时**，R3b-0 会与 C8.4 不一致 —— 这是 vault 留它的另一个理由：可作 regression test reference。\n"
